  "judgeReason": "Variant 1 is the cleanest and most readable. Its grass top has a tidy drip edge, the soil uses sparse, clustered chestnut flecks and small pebbles that should tile without visible seams, and the bricks and pipes have consistent upper-left highlights. Variant 2 has odd black notches cut into the grass top. Variant 3's soil and grass are noisy, with stray dark pixels at the tile edges that would break the tiling."
